# The 23 verbatim third-party mesh binaries are NOT vendored here. They are
# fetched byte-for-byte from their official UFACTORY upstreams (uf-gym MIT +
# xarm_ros2 BSD-3) and sha256-verified by fetch_meshes.py at image-build time.
# Keep them out of git so the third-party geometry is never re-committed.
#
# The 7 AMD-generated CoACD collision hulls
# (meshes/xarm6/collision/{base,link1..link6}_vhacd.obj) ARE tracked in-tree;
# see MESH_PROVENANCE.md. They are deliberately NOT ignored below.
meshes/xarm6/visual/
meshes/gripper/
meshes/xarm6/collision/*.mtl
meshes/xarm6/collision/link2_vhacd2.obj
